                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\begin{aligned}\\text{WTP: }1^2+2^2+3^2+\\cdots+k^2+(k+1)^2&=\\frac16(k+1)((k+1)+1)(2(k+1)+1)\\\\&=\\frac16(k+1)(k+2)(2k+3)\\end{aligned}",
