                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\begin{aligned}LHS&=1^2+2^2+3^2+\\cdots+k^2+(k+1)^2\\\\&=\\frac16 k(k+1)(2k+1)+(k+1)^2,\\quad\\text{using assumption}\\\\&=(k+1)\\times\\left(\\frac16 k(2k+1)+(k+1)\\right)\\\\&=\\frac16(k+1)\\left(k(2k+1)+6k+6\\right)\\\\&=\\frac16(k+1)(2k^2+k+6k+6)\\\\&=\\frac16(k+1)(2k^2+7k+6)\\\\&=\\frac16(k+1)(k+2)(2k+3)\\\\&=RHS\\end{aligned}",
